<snaplet><header>"Snap! Visual Block Editor"</header><script><block>when green flag clicked</block><block>say [Welcome to the Snap! Visual Block Editor!]</block><block>ask [What is your name?] and wait</block><block>say [Hello, [answer]!]</block><block>ask [Would you like to simulate a robot movement?] and wait</block><if><block>question? [yes]</block><then><block>say [Simulating robot movement...]</block><block>move [10] steps</block><block>say [Robot moved forward!]</block></then><else><block>say [Exiting simulation...]</block></else></if><block>wait [1] seconds</block><block>clear graphics</block><block>say [Thank you for using the Snap! Visual Block Editor!]</block><block>wait [1] seconds</block><block>say []</block></script><extensions><extension>Robotics</extension></extensions></snaplet>
